                                    <br>
                                    <a href="#toc-H55D30F92634C464881B9CD2BAD97A591" id="H55D30F92634C464881B9CD2BAD97A591">Sec. 112. Multiyear procurement authority for UH&ndash;60 Blackhawk aircraft.</a></span></span><span><span class="lbexTocSectionOLC">
                                    <br>
                                    <a href="#toc-H12193099309A4E909A7FE89CE13B6E24" id="H12193099309A4E909A7FE89CE13B6E24">Sec. 113. Authorization to initiate early production of future long-range assault aircraft.</a></span></span><span><span class="lbexTocSectionOLC">
                                    <br>
                                    <a href="#toc-H5386C8079395428DA58EC75FC6721C39" id="H5386C8079395428DA58EC75FC6721C39">Sec. 114. Limitation on availability of funds for the Next Generation Command and Control portfolio of capabilities of the Army.</a></span></span><span>
                                <div style="text-align:center" class="lbexTocSubTitleOLC">
                                    <p></p>
