                                    <p style="margin-left: -2em;">
                                        <p class="lbexIndentSubpar">
                                            (C) section 1651 (<a href="http://uscode.house.gov/quicksearch/get.plx?title=10&amp;section=4571">10 U.S.C. 4571</a> note).
                                        </p>
                                    </p>
                                </p>
                            </p>
