                            <p style="margin-left: 0em;">
                                <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndentParagraph">
                                    (5) Of the John S. McCain National Defense Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2019 (<a href="https://www.gpo.gov/fdsys/pkg/PLAW-115publ232/pdf/PLAW-115publ232.pdf">Public Law 115&ndash;232</a>)&mdash;<a id="HF25FD8EF7B134DACB20FF51ECBF16AC7"> </a>
                                    <p style="margin-left: -2em;">
                                        <p class="lbexIndentSubpar">
                                            (A) section 222 (<a href="http://uscode.house.gov/quicksearch/get.plx?title=10&amp;section=4014">10 U.S.C. 4014</a> note);
                                        </p>
                                    </p>
                                    <a id="HDA887292F350436292D27092F2717DD0"> </a>
                                    <p style="margin-left: -2em;">
                                        <p class="lbexIndentSubpar">(B) section 230 (10 U.S.C. note prec. 4061); and</p>
                                    </p>
                                    <a id="H4F65B93FA6284E7193C03B08F824E4E8"> </a>
                                    <p style="margin-left: -2em;">
                                        <p class="lbexIndentSubpar">(C) section 843 (10 U.S.C. note prec. 4171).</p>
                                    </p>
                                </p>
                            </p>
                            <a id="H9A7FB2B65F9A432F91A6330A16A11980"> </a>
                            <p style="margin-left: 0em;">
                                <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndentParagraph">
                                    (6) Of the National Defense Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2018 (<a href="https://www.gpo.gov/fdsys/pkg/PLAW-115publ91/pdf/PLAW-115publ91.pdf">Public Law 115&ndash;91</a>)&mdash;<a id="H6464DCCF0C3F40148B13C5BF5AC93E1C"> </a>
                                    <p style="margin-left: -2em;">
                                        <p class="lbexIndentSubpar">(A) section 849 (131 Stat. 1487);</p>
                                    </p>
                                    <a id="H98ABB01251CA49E0A659CF2F0FBDC283"> </a>
                                    <p style="margin-left: -2em;">
                                        <p class="lbexIndentSubpar">(B) section 874 (10 U.S.C. note prec. 3101);</p>
                                    </p>
                                    <a id="H8B3307EB2C704331A5AC213BF1E12DEF"> </a>
                                    <p style="margin-left: -2em;">
                                        <p class="lbexIndentSubpar">
                                            (C) section 1089 (<a href="http://uscode.house.gov/quicksearch/get.plx?title=10&amp;section=4025">10 U.S.C. 4025</a> note); and
                                        </p>
                                    </p>
                                    <a id="HA5E6381FB6E54AED81F776C8EDD2DB1C"> </a>
                                    <p style="margin-left: -2em;">
                                        <p class="lbexIndentSubpar">
                                            (D) section 1272 (<a href="http://uscode.house.gov/quicksearch/get.plx?title=10&amp;section=4571">10 U.S.C. 4571</a> note).
                                        </p>
                                    </p>
                                </p>
                            </p>
