                            <p style="margin-left: 0em;">
                                <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndentParagraph">
                                    (7) Section 925(b) of the National Defense Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2017 (<a href="https://www.gpo.gov/fdsys/pkg/PLAW-114publ328/pdf/PLAW-114publ328.pdf">Public Law 114&ndash;328</a>; <a href="http://uscode.house.gov/quicksearch/get.plx?title=10&amp;section=4271">10 U.S.C. 4271</a> note).
                                </p>
                            </p>
