                            <p style="margin-left: 0em;">
                                <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndentParagraph">
                                    (8) Of the National Defense Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2016 (<a href="https://www.gpo.gov/fdsys/pkg/PLAW-114publ92/pdf/PLAW-114publ92.pdf">Public Law 114&ndash;92</a>)&mdash;<a id="H8C50EEE6DB6A43B9962C1A7DF9416AB0"> </a>
