                                <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndentParagraph">
                                    (12) Of the Ike Skelton National Defense Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2011 (<a href="https://www.gpo.gov/fdsys/pkg/PLAW-111publ383/pdf/PLAW-111publ383.pdf">Public Law 111&ndash;383</a>)&mdash;<a id="HF1C9B32BA6ED4276A191A3ADD236AE60"> </a>
