                                <a href="#toc-H691E09222ECF48919C99F29A861AE648" id="H691E09222ECF48919C99F29A861AE648">Sec. 1271. Limitation on availability of funds for travel expenses of the Office of the Secretary of Defense.</a></span></span><span><span class="lbexTocSectionOLC">
