                                <br>
                                <a href="#toc-H4DEC6F8E7B1F477683A956E1EEE7005C" id="H4DEC6F8E7B1F477683A956E1EEE7005C">Sec. 1807. Establishment of Project Spectrum.</a></span></span><span>
                            <div style="text-align:center" class="lbexTocSubTitleOLC">
                                <p></p>
