                        </span><span><span class="lbexTocSectionOLC">
                                <br>
                                <a href="#toc-H21388AFDCFED47E8A1A719D86B41F5C9" id="H21388AFDCFED47E8A1A719D86B41F5C9">Sec. 1811. Modifications to Joint Requirements Oversight Council.</a></span></span><span><span class="lbexTocSectionOLC">
                                <br>
                                <a href="#toc-HCF8A50B5418C4033BF6DFEC846D24DB5" id="HCF8A50B5418C4033BF6DFEC846D24DB5">Sec. 1812. Ensuring successful implementation of requirements reform.</a></span></span><span>
                            <div style="text-align:center" class="lbexTocSubTitleOLC">
                                <p></p>
                                <a href="#toc-HD61748CAF76D425787D5F19380A2A507" id="HD61748CAF76D425787D5F19380A2A507">Subtitle C&mdash;Matters Relating to Commercial Products and Commercial Services
