                        <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndent">
                            (b) <span class="lbexSectionLevelOLCnuclear">Outside the united states</span>.&mdash;Using amounts appropriated pursuant to the authorization of appropriations in section 2103(a) and available for military construction projects outside the United States as specified in the funding table in section 4601, the Secretary of the Army may acquire real property and carry out military construction projects for the installations or locations outside the United States, and in the amounts, set forth in the following table:
