                        <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndent">
                            (a) <span class="lbexSectionLevelOLCnuclear">Extension</span>.&mdash;Notwithstanding section 2002 of the Military Construction Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2023 (division B of <a href="https://www.gpo.gov/fdsys/pkg/PLAW-117publ263/pdf/PLAW-117publ263.pdf">Public Law 117&ndash;263</a>; 136 Stat. 2970), the authorization set forth in the table in subsection (b), as provided in section 2101 of that Act (136 Stat. 2971), shall remain in effect until October 1, 2026, or the date of the enactment of an Act authorizing funds for military construction for fiscal year 2027, whichever is later.
                        </p>
