                        <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexHang">
                            <a href="#HADCD4A26C8E14848AC9568AD2C7A2AF7" id="toc-HADCD4A26C8E14848AC9568AD2C7A2AF7">
                                <div class="lbexHangWithMargin" style="clear:both;">
                                    <a id="HADCD4A26C8E14848AC9568AD2C7A2AF7"> </a><span class="lbexSectionlevelOLC">SEC. 2107.</span><span class="lbexSectionlevelOLC"> <span class="lbexAllcap">Modification of authority to carry out fiscal year 2025 project at Smith Barracks, Germany</span>.</span>
                                </div>
                            </a>
                        </p>
                        <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndent">
                            <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndent">
                                In the case of the authorization contained in the table in section 2101(b) of the Military Construction Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2025 (division B of <a href="https://www.gpo.gov/fdsys/pkg/PLAW-118publ159/pdf/PLAW-118publ159.pdf">Public Law 118&ndash;159</a>; 138 Stat. 2213) for Hohenfels Training Area, for construction of a barracks as specified in the funding table in section 4601 of such Act, the Secretary of the Army may construct a barracks at Smith Barracks, Germany.
                            </p>
                        </p>
                        <a id="HB24DE4E1EFA8403C932939F8EC537834"> </a>
                        <p>
                            <div style="text-align:center">
                                <a href="#HB24DE4E1EFA8403C932939F8EC537834" id="toc-HB24DE4E1EFA8403C932939F8EC537834"><span class="lbexTitleLevelOLC">TITLE XXII</span><span class="lbexTitleLevelOLC"><span style="text-align:center">&mdash;</span><span class="lbexAllcap">Navy Military Construction</span></span></a>
                            </div>
                        </p>
                        <p></p>
                        <span><span class="lbexTocSectionOLC">
                                <br>
                                <a href="#toc-HE55A42EB3E9446D3B34ABB710C997034" id="HE55A42EB3E9446D3B34ABB710C997034">Sec. 2201. Authorized Navy construction and land acquisition projects.</a></span></span><span><span class="lbexTocSectionOLC">
                                <br>
