                        <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexHang">
                            <a href="#H1EF4A25DBE124EB2A30CCA84BFD5D138" id="toc-H1EF4A25DBE124EB2A30CCA84BFD5D138">
                                <div class="lbexHangWithMargin" style="clear:both;">
                                    <a id="H1EF4A25DBE124EB2A30CCA84BFD5D138"> </a><span class="lbexSectionlevelOLC">SEC. 2205.</span><span class="lbexSectionlevelOLC"> <span class="lbexAllcap">Extension of authority to carry out certain fiscal year 2022 projects</span>.</span>
                                </div>
                            </a>
                        </p>
                        <a id="H92E441CA26FA44EBA8DBD562F3179087"> </a>
                        <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndent">
                            (a) <span class="lbexSectionLevelOLCnuclear">Extension</span>.&mdash;Notwithstanding section 2002 of the Military Construction Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2022 (division B of <a href="https://www.gpo.gov/fdsys/pkg/PLAW-117publ81/pdf/PLAW-117publ81.pdf">Public Law 117&ndash;81</a>; 135 Stat. 2161), the authorizations set forth in the table in subsection (b), as provided in sections 2201 and 2202 of that Act (135 Stat. 2166, 2167) and extended by section 2207 of the Military Construction Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2025 (division B of <a href="https://www.gpo.gov/fdsys/pkg/PLAW-118publ159/pdf/PLAW-118publ159.pdf">Public Law 118&ndash;159</a>; 138 Stat. 2221), shall remain in effect until October 1, 2026, or the date of the enactment of an Act authorizing funds for military construction for fiscal year 2027, whichever is later.
                        </p>
                        <a id="HEB94EFBFBA104CFC9969B0901835727C"> </a>
                        <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndent">
                            (b) <span class="lbexSectionLevelOLCnuclear">Table</span>.&mdash;The table referred to in subsection (a) is as follows:
                            <br>
                            <br>
