                        <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexHang">
                            <a href="#H0B0866A7D4D9449F9ADCF8A3A3002C29" id="toc-H0B0866A7D4D9449F9ADCF8A3A3002C29">
                                <div class="lbexHangWithMargin" style="clear:both;">
                                    <a id="H0B0866A7D4D9449F9ADCF8A3A3002C29"> </a><span class="lbexSectionlevelOLC">SEC. 2309.</span><span class="lbexSectionlevelOLC"> <span class="lbexAllcap">Modification of authority to carry out certain fiscal year 2025 projects</span>.</span>
                                </div>
                            </a>
                        </p>
                        <a id="HED6AAABFDB7B4551837EE5B696E91BF4"> </a>
                        <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndent">
                            (a) <span class="lbexSectionLevelOLCnuclear">F.E. Warren Air Force Base, Wyoming</span>.&mdash;In the case of the authorization contained in the table in section 2301(a) of the Military Construction Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2025 (division B of <a href="https://www.gpo.gov/fdsys/pkg/PLAW-118publ159/pdf/PLAW-118publ159.pdf">Public Law 118&ndash;159</a>; 138 Stat. 2222) for F.E. Warren Air Force Base, Wyoming, for the Ground Based Strategic Deterrent Utility Corridor, the Secretary of the Air Force may construct 3,219 kilometers of telephone duct facility.
                        </p>
                        <a id="H8DC8C0367D414DF085BB4020A9CFD965"> </a>
                        <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndent">
                            (b) <span class="lbexSectionLevelOLCnuclear">Yap International Airport, Federated States of Micronesia</span>.&mdash;<a id="H1430179078F14715B89F094FB27AAD35"> </a>
                            <p style="margin-left: 0em;">
                                <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndentParagraph">
                                    (1) <span style="font-size:110%; text-transform: capitalize;">A</span>UTHORIZATION OF APPROPRIATIONS.&mdash;The authorization table included in subsection (b) of section 2301 of the Military Construction Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2025 is amended in the item relating to Yap International Airport, Federated States of Micronesia, by striking &ldquo;$949,314,000&rdquo; and inserting &ldquo;$1,495,314,000&rdquo;.
                                </p>
                            </p>
                            <a id="H321D2173C96B47F68AC713C2D2BB9D2F"> </a>
                            <p style="margin-left: 0em;">
                                <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndentParagraph">
                                    (2) <span style="font-size:110%; text-transform: capitalize;">F</span>UNDING TABLE.&mdash;Such Act is further amended in the table of section 4601 by striking &ldquo;Airfield Pavement Upgrades&rdquo; and inserting &ldquo;PDI: Airfield Apron and Taxiway&rdquo;.
                                </p>
                            </p>
                        </p>
                        <a id="HAE490CF69CA04CF3B5F54137D9D95AA1"> </a>
                        <p>
