                                <br>
                                <a href="#toc-H7C2B53429EDD4675A45DCE9B9D4E873B" id="H7C2B53429EDD4675A45DCE9B9D4E873B">Sec. 2874. Authority of a Secretary concerned to carry out certain unspecified minor military construction projects.</a></span></span><span>
