                        <a id="H5D6404ED081344398E454665485E1EFF"> </a>
                        <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndent">
                            (a) <span class="lbexSectionLevelOLCnuclear">Short title</span>.&mdash;This division may be cited as the &ldquo;Department of State Authorization Act for Fiscal Year 2026&rdquo;.
                        </p>
                        <a id="H7915E25CA1104AAFA2FD3FB94C2FECA5"> </a>
                        <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndent">
