                            </p>
                        </p>
                        <a id="HC8062EA6A84F404A9FC388003E6061CA"> </a>
                        <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndent">
                            (b) <span class="lbexSectionLevelOLCnuclear">Redesignations and transfers</span>.&mdash;<a id="H3661DFAB63AB4199A8A8C13FFE080ECF"> </a>
                            <p style="margin-left: 0em;">
                                <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndentParagraph">
                                    (1) <span style="font-size:110%; text-transform: capitalize;">R</span>EQUIREMENT.&mdash;The sections of title 14, United States Code, identified in the table provided in paragraph (2) are amended&mdash;<a id="H84B0C1E84B5742B887EF38D99C23B338"> </a>
                                    <p style="margin-left: -2em;">
                                        <p class="lbexIndentSubpar">(A) by redesignating the sections as described in the table; and</p>
                                    </p>
                                    <a id="HD479ED81C5C44BC5B383B4012B2B3447"> </a>
                                    <p style="margin-left: -2em;">
                                        <p class="lbexIndentSubpar">(B) by transferring the sections, as necessary, so that the sections appear after the table of sections for chapter 3 of such title (as added by subsection (a)), in the order in which the sections are presented in the table.</p>
                                    </p>
                                </p>
                            </p>
                            <a id="H18F4C8BF6A354832B853342EB70D5C54"> </a>
                            <p style="margin-left: 0em;">
                                <p style="text-align:left" class="lbexIndentParagraph">
                                    (2) <span style="font-size:110%; text-transform: capitalize;">T</span>ABLE.&mdash;The table referred to in paragraph (1) is the following:
